+}
+
+// List all
+for (ServiceDescriptor service : registry.listServices()) {
+  System.out.println(service.getName() + ": " + 
+      service.getCapabilities());
+}
+
+System.out.println(registry.generateRegistry());
+```
+
+**Capabilities:**
+- Service registration
+- Service lookup
+- Metadata storage
+- Capability querying
+- Service listing
+
+**Use Cases:**
